id: makyo-star-power-of-the-homeworld
name: Power of the Homeworld
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  The Makyo Star approaches, heralding an auspicious moment for you in your fight.
text: >
  Power of the Homeworld: The Makyo Star approaches, heralding an auspicious moment for you in your fight.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Might by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: While you possess 3+ stacks of Demonic Power, increase your Tier of Power by 1 (see — Breakthrough).
  (3)-[Passive]: While you possess 3+ stacks of Demonic Fatigue, increase the Damage Category of all Attacking Maneuvers that target you by 1 Category for your damage calculation.
  (4)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Make a Pressure Check. If you succeed, make a Might Clash against all Opponents within a Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you win, they gain a stack of the Shaken and Broken Combat Conditions until the start of your next turn.

---

# Written, not applied yet: its effects arrive with its stage (the plan).
